🎬 Movie Recommendation System
A content-based recommendation system built using movie metadata, designed to suggest similar films based on key descriptive features such as genres, keywords, cast, and plot summaries.

📌 Features

Data preprocessing and feature extraction

Text vectorization using TF-IDF

Similarity computation using cosine similarity

Custom recommendation function to retrieve similar movies

Exploratory analysis of movie attributes and metadata

🛠 Tools Used
Python · Pandas · NumPy · Scikit-learn · Jupyter Notebook

📁 Main File
Movie Recommendation.ipynb — full analysis and complete recommendation pipeline
